mbb:Concept_signet a mbb:Concept ; rdfs:label "signet"@en ; mbb:mentionedInPart mbb:Chapter_11 ; mbb:indexedIn mbb:Sec_ch11_012 ; mbb:indexedIn mbb:Sec_ch11_013 ; mbb:indexSubentry "signet" .
