mbb:Passage_ch11_challenge_script a mbb:Passage ; rdfs:label "Where The Blockchain first indexes challenge script"@en ; mbb:inPart mbb:Chapter_11 ; mbb:text "If you want to use a different signet, called a custom signet, you will need to know the script used to determine when a block is authorized, called the challenge script." ; mbb:sourceLine 715 ; mbb:sourceFile "ch11_blockchain.adoc" ; mbb:pinnedCommit "275c4eb8eab8800c6adc39f8def8e8f8fa356a57" ; dcterms:source mbb:Work ; dcterms:creator "Andreas M. Antonopoulos", "David A. Harding" ; dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/> .
